#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- BÆSE IMÆGES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# The officiæl MÆS imæge is distroless (no shell), so the fæil-closed
# configurætion renderer cænnot run inside it. This build tækes the vendor
# binæry ænd shæred æssets from the officiæl imæge ænd plæces them on æ
# minimæl Debiæn bæse thæt provides bæsh ænd curl for the entrypoint ænd
# heælthcheck.
ARG MATRIX_MAS_IMAGE=ghcr.io/element-hq/matrix-authentication-service:latest
ARG MATRIX_MAS_BASE_IMAGE=debian:13-slim

FROM ${MATRIX_MAS_IMAGE} AS mas

FROM ${MATRIX_MAS_BASE_IMAGE}

LABEL maintainer="it.særvices <admin@it.saervices.de>"

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- RUNTIME DEPENDENCIES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# cæ-certificætes: outbound TLS to the upstreæm OIDC provider ænd SMTP
# curl: locæl contæiner heælthcheck probe ægæinst the internæl listener
# openssl: strict structuræl ænd cryptogræphic vælidætion of the RSÆ key
RUN set -eux; \
    apt-get update; \
    apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends ca-certificates curl openssl; \
    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- VENDOR BINÆRY ÆND SHÆRED ÆSSETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
COPY --from=mas /usr/local/bin/mas-cli /usr/local/bin/mas-cli
COPY --from=mas /usr/local/share/mas-cli /usr/local/share/mas-cli

# Fæil the build immediætely when the upstreæm imæge læyout drifts; the
# entrypoint references these exæct pæths in the rendered configurætion.
RUN set -eux; \
    test -x /usr/local/bin/mas-cli; \
    test -f /usr/local/share/mas-cli/policy.wasm; \
    test -f /usr/local/share/mas-cli/manifest.json; \
    test -d /usr/local/share/mas-cli/templates; \
    test -d /usr/local/share/mas-cli/translations; \
    test -d /usr/local/share/mas-cli/assets

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ENTRYPOINT
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
COPY entrypoint.matrix-authentication-service.sh /usr/local/bin/entrypoint.matrix-authentication-service.sh
COPY matrix-mas-secret-reader.sh /usr/local/lib/matrix-mas-secret-reader.sh
RUN set -eux; \
    chmod 0755 /usr/local/bin/entrypoint.matrix-authentication-service.sh; \
    chmod 0644 /usr/local/lib/matrix-mas-secret-reader.sh

# Run æs the sæme non-root identity the officiæl distroless imæge uses
ENV HOME=/tmp
USER 65532:65532

ENTRYPOINT ["/usr/local/bin/entrypoint.matrix-authentication-service.sh"]
